<ul>
<li>Monday 12-1:20pm: Groups 1 &amp; 2</li>
<li>Wednesday 12-1:20pm: Groups 3 &amp; 4</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Submit as:</strong> File upload (PDF, PPT, DOCX) OR text entry.</p>
<p><strong>Grading:</strong> 3 points for demonstrating presentation preparation.</p>]]></mattext>
          </material>
        </presentation>
      </item>

    </section>
  </assessment>
